# syslinux-mbr.bin

This file is the standard SYSLINUX MBR bootstrap used as a known-good
reference MBR for bootloader tests.

The SYSLINUX MBR source is explicitly placed in the public domain.

This copy was obtained from:
    /usr/lib/syslinux/bios/mbr.bin

It is used only by the test infrastructure and is not part of the
my_mbr bootloader itself.
